# ============================================================
# cPanel Phusion Passenger Configuration - Antrian Photobox
# ============================================================
# Mengatur batas minimum dan maksimum proses Node.js di cPanel
# Catatan Arsitektur: 
#   - Cukup gunakan 1 proses (MaxPoolSize 1) agar broadcast SSE (real-time) 
#     tersinkronisasi dengan sempurna ke semua layar klien tanpa konflik multi-proses.
#   - 1 Proses Node.js terbukti mampu melayani hingga 200+ request/detik (1000 user).
PassengerMinInstances 1
PassengerMaxPoolSize 1
